  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice red onion.\n• In a small bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add it to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beedf83f90c073aba9d09/step-c44c2300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice Kumato into wedges.\n• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and thinly slice.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beedf83f90c073aba9d09/step-356a3a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook ciabatta until golden and slightly crispy, 5-6 minutes. Season to taste.\n• In the last minute of cook time, add garlic, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and another drizzle of olive oil, tossing, until fragrant. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beedf83f90c073aba9d09/step-01cd7920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded.\n• Remove pan from heat and add the honey and a splash of water, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beedf83f90c073aba9d09/step-77ad7a30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled onion.\n• In a large bowl, combine basil pesto and a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add spinach & rocket mix, Kumato, avocado, pickled onion and croutons. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beedf83f90c073aba9d09/step-9d228b40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rainbow Kumato salad between bowls. Top with seared haloumi.\n• Garnish with pine nuts. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beedf83f90c073aba9d09/step-3c5bfb50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
